<title>JAPAN: Nissin Food plans share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Nissin Food plans share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissin Food Products Co Ltd said on Monday that it was planning to buy back up to 6.0 million of its common shares at a cost not to exceed 15 billion yen.</p>
<p>The firm said in a statement that the share repurchase will be conducted after the plan is approved at a stockholders' meeting scheduled for June 27.</p>
</text>
